            <history xml:id="history_id6e0813c6">
               <p xml:id="idm243">It is not known for certain when Gade composed these pieces, which were published for the first time in 1861. The dedicatée, Princess Anna of Hessen-Kassel, was very interested in music. Her husband was the brother of the Danish Queen Louise; the married couple lived in Denmark until the war between Denmark, Prussia and Austria in 1864.</p>
            </history>
